Package: python3-avtools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-ffmpeg, python3-mutagen, python3-pil, ffmpeg
Description: Local media utilities and ElevenLabs API wrapper
 Provides Media (ffmpeg/mutagen/PIL-based tagging, cover art, scaling,
 probing) and Services (ElevenLabs API wrapper: TTS, speech-to-speech,
 forced/word alignment). The elevenlabs package itself is not a hard dependency — Services imports
 it lazily per function.
